    "Long ride - we knew we had it coming. Lots of big ups and downs. We passed the Arctic Circle and chatted with two very interesting families there. Looking across the Eagle River at the final climb we had ahead was quite disspiriting, but we pulled it off and arrived about 9pm at the Eagle Plains Hotel, the halfway point on the Dempster!",
